{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791251400, "covers_from": "2026-10-06T01:50:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-06T01:51:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791251460, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-06T01:50:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 57457, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "育兒", "content": "帶小孩去公共場合，或搭乘大眾運輸時，會因孩子吵鬧被不友善的對待，甚至公審。育兒環境的不友善怎麼辦？", "display_name": "內湖代表 Nell Hsu", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T01:50:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 57458, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "昨日10/5的一場雨，我從北門走到萬華，一路走一路閃地上的積水，不知有沒有辦法讓行人磚不再成為積水坑", "display_name": "萬華代表 41", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T01:50:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 19944, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我希望機車停車格可以劃設成斜的，一方面停車時可以順順進入格子，一方面後退出格子時也可以順順的。", "display_name": "文山代表 No.19,944", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T01:50:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11316, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "落實無障礙空間。", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.11,316", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T01:50:50+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9849, "sprite_key": "turtle_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "長照", "content": "長照服務為什麼很敷衍、不積極", "display_name": "中正代表 A-Chiang（阿強）", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T01:50:55+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 21178, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "環境", "content": "路邊垃圾桶變少了 很不方便", "display_name": "北投代表 No.21,178", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 57458, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown"